# Caddy reverse proxy for the voice-ws WebSocket worker.
#
# Caddy automatically provisions a Let's Encrypt certificate for
# voice.247ai.live the first time it starts, provided:
#   1. voice.247ai.live has an A record pointing at this VM's public IP, and
#   2. ports 80 and 443 are reachable from the internet (OCI security list +
#      host iptables open for 80/443).
#
# Caddy terminates TLS and proxies both /ws (browser audio) and /twilio
# (Twilio Media Streams) plus /health to the voice-ws container on 7860.
voice.247ai.live {
	reverse_proxy voice-ws:7860
}